# Language Policy

Canonical rule: **`.agents/rules/language-policy.md`** — read it in full before acting. It is shared by every agent tool (Cursor, Claude Code, others); edit that file, not this pointer.

In one line: Code, tooling, skills, rules and plans in English; vault notes French-first at the vault root; `en/` only on translation tasks; bump `last_modified` on every substantive FR edit.
